Package: RangeMap
Title: RangeMap
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Scott", "Zimmer", , "scott.zimmer@usda.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Scott Zimmer <scott.zimmer@usda.gov>
Description: This package provides functions to work with data from the RangeMap model (https://doi.org/10.2737/RDS-2026-0058). This model provides a raster layer of plot IDs and many vegetation attributes associated with the plots, including plant functional group cover, vegetation heights, species composition, fuels, soil stability, and canopy gaps. The RangeMap package allows users to generate raster layers of plot attributes, or areas of species occurrence.
